OL,3,GNEWSAHow a plot to smuggle cocaine in
OL,4,Acheese and chocolate spread was smashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo the unsuspecting eye, the delivery
OL,7,Fof everyday foodstuffs like cheese or
OL,8,Fchocolate spread to a nondescript
OL,9,Ftrading estate would barely register -
OL,10,Fyet, the industrial-scale quantities of
OL,11,Fthose goods which arrived in several
OL,12,Fformer mill towns in northern England
OL,13,Fin just over a year contained a far
OL,14,Fmore sinister ingredient - and they
OL,15,Fconcealed what was later described as a
OL,16,F"vast and complex criminal operation"
OL,17,Fwith its roots in South America.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
