OL,3,GNEWSAHow a plot to smuggle cocaine in
OL,4,Acheese and chocolate spread was smashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week, 15 men were jailed over
OL,7,Ftheir roles in that operation - an
OL,8,Finternational conspiracy to supply up
OL,9,Fto #1.4bn worth of cocaine between
OL,10,FOctober 2022 and December 2023, which
OL,11,Fended with one of the largest police
OL,12,Fforces in England and Wales securing
OL,13,Fits biggest ever bust.
OL,15,FThe operation saw industrial units in
OL,16,FHuddersfield, Cleckheaton and Halifax
OL,17,Fin West Yorkshire and in Blackburn,
OL,18,FLancashire, provide the perfect cover
OL,19,Ffor seemingly ordinary shrink-wrapped
OL,20,Fpallets to be sorted.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
