OL,3,GNEWSAHow a plot to smuggle cocaine in
OL,4,Acheese and chocolate spread was smashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs other perfectly legitimate
OL,7,Fbusinesses traded from neighbouring
OL,8,Funits, cocaine which had been ordered
OL,9,Ffrom South America would be cut out of
OL,10,Fblocks of gouda cheese and, later,
OL,11,Fother foodstuffs and re-packaged in
OL,12,Fcardboard boxes or black bin bags.
